$MDESC::Type = "CTF Mixed";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Peace and Love" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> After years a battle the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have decided to call it quits and sign a peace treaty. Both tribes have agreed to send sky docks to the planet Peace and Love where the treaty will be signed. A ceremonial bridge will link together both sky docks in a symbol of unity. However, the anger and rage held within each tribe member can not be tamed nor amended. Instead of a peaceful meeting both tribes plan to attack each other at the ceremonies. Engineers of both tribes has modified their long range teleporter to be able to teleport a person inside the enemy base. The fighting continues." @
         "\n\n<f1>Mission designed by:<f0> EEPROM (Mappers Extreme)";

